<section id="faq" style="background:var(--bg-soft)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow center"><span class="dot"></span> Questions</div>
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list reveal">
      <details class="faq-item" open>
        <summary>Is it safe to use in the shower?<svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">Yes. Vortiq Pro carries an IPX7 waterproof rating, meaning the sealed motor housing is fully safe for direct water exposure in showers, tubs, and sinks.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How long does the battery last?<svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">A full 3-hour USB-C charge gives you up to 120 minutes of continuous run time on Eco mode — enough to clean an entire home in one charge.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Which brush heads come included?<svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">Every Vortiq Pro ships with all 8 heads: flat scrubber, dome brush, detail brush, bristle head, scouring pad, buffing pad, microfiber pad and sponge pad, plus the telescopic extension pole.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Will it scratch delicate surfaces like glass or acrylic?<svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">No — the soft sponge head paired with Eco mode (150 RPM) is specifically designed for glass, mirrors, acrylic tubs, and other delicate surfaces.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What's your return policy?<svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">Every order is covered by a 30-day money-back guarantee. If you're not happy, contact us for a full refund — no return shipping hassle for defective units.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How fast is shipping?<svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">Orders ship free across the UK and typically arrive within 3-5 business days.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "FAQ", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
